{"text": "From: Constance Okafor-Bell <connie@okaforbell-books.example>\nTo: Mateus Carvalho dos Santos <mateus@driftlessroasters.example>\nDate: Thu, 15 Jan 2026 08:52:40 -0600\nSubject: Re: 1099s - still missing W-9s (3 vendors)\n\nMateus,\n\nThanks, that helps. Where we are for Driftless Roasters Cooperative (EIN 39-2284176):\n\nDONE - I have good W-9s and totals for these two:\n  * Lindgren Mechanical (Hunter Lindgren, sole prop). He gave his\n    SSN, 622-58-8948, not an EIN. 2025 payments $8,640.00 (roaster\n    repairs). Address N3172 County Road K, Viroqua, WI 54665.\n  * Coulee Region Design Studio LLC, EIN 87-1930442, $3,200.00.\n    Single-member LLC, so it still gets a Form 1099-NEC.\n\nSTILL MISSING:\n  * Xiomara Quiñones (the farmers market staffing). You paid her\n    $5,475 by Venmo and check. The W-9 she sent has a 9-digit number\n    with no dashes, 948735521, which starts with a 9 - that is an\n    ITIN, not an SSN. That is fine for the 1099, but please do not ask\n    her about her immigration status; it is not our business and we do\n    not need it. I only need her to confirm the mailing address:\n    418 1/2 Cass St, Upper, La Crosse, WI 54601?\n  * Bao Vang (delivery driver, Jan-May). No W-9 at all. Last known\n    cell 608 555 0191. If we cannot get one by the deadline we\n    file with what we have and you start backup withholding at 24% on\n    anything further. Paid $2,210.00.\n\nTotals go in Box 1. Filing deadline is January 31 so I need\nanswers by Friday the 23rd. My fee for the five forms is $125 flat,\nsame as last year - you can pay the invoice (INV-2026-0042) at\nhttps://pay.okaforbell-books.example/i/INV-2026-0042.\n\nConnie\n\n--\nConstance Okafor-Bell, EA\nOkafor-Bell Bookkeeping & Tax, LLC\n211 Pearl Street, Ste B, La Crosse, WI 54601\n(608) 555-0149  |  fax (608) 555-0150\n\nOn Wed, Jan 14, 2026 at 4:17 PM Mateus Carvalho dos Santos wrote:\n> Hi Connie - sorry for the delay. Hunter dropped his form off, photo\n> attached. I texted Xiomara and she sent hers too. I don't have\n> anything for Bao, he moved to St. Paul I think. Do we really\n> need one from the design studio? They're an LLC.\n>\n> Also for your records the co-op's new checking account for your\n> autopay is at Mississippi Bluffs Credit Union, routing 067965120,\n> account 4471002286. Old one closes at month end.\n>\n> M.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "389 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Constance Okafor-Bell", "Mateus Carvalho dos Santos", "Lindgren", "Xiomara Quiñones", "Bao Vang", "Connie", "Hunter", "Xiomara", "Bao"], "companies": ["Driftless Roasters Cooperative", "Coulee Region Design Studio LLC", "okaforbell-books", "pay.okaforbell-books.example", "design studio", "Mississippi Bluffs Credit Union", "co-op's new checking account", "LLC"]}, "topics": {"places": ["La Crosse", "Upper", "Viroqua", "Cass St", "County Road K", "WI 54665", "St. Paul", "Mississippi Bluffs Credit Union"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["SSN", "ITIN", "immigration status"], "names": ["Hunter", "Xiomara", "Bao", "Mateus", "Connie"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 1.3999999985098839, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 27, "text": "Constance Okafor-Bell", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Constance Okafor-Bell"}, {"start": 29, "end": 60, "text": "connie@okaforbell-books.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "connie@okaforbell-books.example"}, {"start": 66, "end": 92, "text": "Mateus Carvalho dos Santos", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "cano